ExactFillSettler_finaliseAsSettled
├── when orderStatus[orderId] is not Opened
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderStatus
├── when paymentSettled is false
│   └── it should revert with PaymentNotSettled
├── when the rollover fillRecord is missing
│   └── it should revert with InvalidFillRecord
├── when status is Opened AND both legs filled AND paymentSettled is true
│   ├── it should transition status from Opened to Settled
│   ├── it should dstCST.safeTransfer the escrowed amount to fillRecord.destination
│   └── it should emit OrderFinalised with status Settled
├── when dstCST.safeTransfer reverts
│   └── it should still transition to Settled, credit rescueable[orderId][filler] the amount, and emit FillerRescueCredited (blacklist-safe — closes #39)
├── when called by any msg.sender
│   └── it should succeed (permissionless)
└── when the Settled branch reaches the payout
    └── it should emit OrderAttribution once with fillerSlot == premiumFiller == cellarFiller on the happy path (Task 36 / #47)
